From 6dd1f42038f5b599345a790ea51cb2ddbc6da982 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivan Evlogiev <quic_ievlogie@quicinc.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Dec 2021 09:36:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] nn-framework: Add cmake option to enable/disable CPU
 implementation

- Add cmake option NN_INCLUDE_CPU_IMPLEMENTATION to enable
cpu implementation in nn framework
- By default cpu implementation is disabled

